    "language": "English",
    "original_prompt": "Elara, a guild infiltrator, is sent to retrieve the master blueprint from the Echo Archive, a self-sealing tomb built by paranoid architect Silas Vance. She must navigate its trapped rooms, solve acoustic puzzles, and collect Chronos Keys to synthesize the Master Chronos Core. With the core, she can enter the Chronos Vault, claim the blueprint, and activate the surface lift before her oxygen expires.",
    "image_url": "assets/the-echo-archive-riddle-t-e6xvqrpl_cover_2c4c6065.jpg",
    "rule_enforcement_mode": "rpg",
    "time_per_turn": 1,
