      "hp_change": 0,
      "stamina_change": 0,
      "mana_change": 0,
      "text_log_content": "SYNTHESIS OF THE MASTER CHRONOS CORE:\nInsert and combine all four harmonic keys—##CHRONOS_KEY_1 (Prime), ##CHRONOS_KEY_2 (Sub-Bass), ##CHRONOS_KEY_3 (Resonant), and ##CHRONOS_KEY_4 (Apex)—simultaneously. Their converging frequencies will fuse the four forks into the singular Master Chronos Core required to unlock the Chronos Vault.",
